XiangLens Image Fixture License and Attribution Notice

The source images in this directory are downloaded from Wikimedia Commons.
Each source file retains the license shown in source_manifest.yaml. Derived
fixtures retain the license of their corresponding source image, as recorded in
manifest.yaml.

The portrait sources are licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike
4.0 International. Cultural sources are public domain, CC0, or Creative Commons
licensed on a per-file basis. The public-domain QR auxiliary remains public
domain.

Wikimedia Commons source pages, authors, license names, license URLs, download
URLs, and SHA-256 hashes are recorded in source_manifest.yaml. Reusers must
follow the attribution and ShareAlike requirements of each source license.

The deterministic overlays and fixture-building code are project-authored.
Fake names, identifiers, email addresses, locations, and tokens are test data
and do not describe the people shown in the source photographs.
